{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q11", "domain": "unknown", "question": "大约哪个时间段，运程最佳？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据提供的信息，命主八字日主丁火，生于子月，金水当令，身弱喜木火。紫微斗数盘中，命宫巨门旺，迁移宫太阳旺化权、文曲化科，四化吉象在外。分析各选项对应的紫微大限与八字大运：\n\n- **A. 23—32岁**：紫微大限在夫妻宫，太阴庙加禄存，财运尚可；但八字行丁酉、丙申运，金重财多耗身，压力不小，非最佳。\n- **B. 33—42岁**：紫微大限在子女宫，紫微天府得地，辅星陀罗；八字走丙申、乙未运初期，仍受金克，未得全暖。\n- **C. 43—52岁**：紫微大限在财帛宫，天机陷落无吉，财运不稳；八字在乙未运后半，木火渐生，但紫微财帛破耗，难称上佳。\n- **D. 53—62岁**：紫微大限在疾厄宫，破军庙旺带天魁，开创力强，且迁移宫太阳旺化权、文曲化科，外出得名望权威，科权交会，格局高强。八字同步行甲午大运，正印生身，日主得午火禄根，身旺足以担财官，为一生巅峰之运。\n\n综合判断，53—62岁运程最佳。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1c", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_19611230_P003-Q11", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1c_R1_P4_G1\\details_2024_b1c_R1_P4_G1.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 26677, "response_id": "9ba1df17-ba76-4150-be43-3e5c313f9126", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 732, "completion_tokens": 1871, "total_tokens": 2603, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 640}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1533}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 640, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 92}}
{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q12", "domain": "relationship", "question": "何时结婚？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主的八字和紫微斗数命盘分析，重点考察婚姻应期。\n\n八字方面，日柱丁酉，夫妻宫为酉金偏财。男命以正财为妻，但原局财星多现（天干庚辛金、地支酉丑合金），财旺身弱，丁火日主在子月失令，早年可能感情多但不易早定。幸而早运走火土帮身，有助于婚姻落实。\n\n紫微斗数中，夫妻宫在酉，主星太阴庙，辅星有文昌、禄存，太阴为温柔美貌之妻星，禄存为财禄，文昌主才情，构成不错的婚姻宫位。尤其关键的是，23-32岁大限正行夫妻宫，流年引动夫妻宫星曜的概率极大。文昌化忌虽可能带来文书或沟通上的波折，但整体宫位吉利，大限又重合，正是婚缘成熟的典型应期。身宫在福德宫天梁旺，也显示命主并非无婚之人。子女宫紫微天府虽强，但33岁之后的大限更偏向于事业和子女，而非初婚最佳时段。综合判断，命主在23-32岁之间结婚的可能性最高。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1c", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_19611230_P003-Q12", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1c_R1_P4_G1\\details_2024_b1c_R1_P4_G1.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 35592, "response_id": "0bcb0760-f08b-4f0e-9726-269c691735b9", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 725, "completion_tokens": 2249, "total_tokens": 2974, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 640}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1975}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 640, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 85}}
